, Georgios and Beer, Meinrad and Rodriguez-Granillo, Gastón A and Selvanayagam, Joseph and Lopez-Jimenez, Francisco and De Bosscher, Ruben and Tavildari, Alain and Figtree, Gemma and Danad, Ibrahim and Shantouf, Ronney and Kietselaer, Bas and Tousoulis, Dimitris and Dangas, George and Mehta, Nehal N and Kotanidis, Christos and Kunadian, Vijay and Fairbairn, Timothy A.},
	title = {Cost-effectiveness of a novel AI technology to quantify coronary inflammation and cardiovascular risk in patients undergoing routine coronary computed tomography angiography},
