	affiliations = {School of Business, VIT-AP University, Andhra Pradesh, Amaravathi, India},
	abstract = {This research explores how education and awareness can empower sustainable finance by promoting responsible usage of artificial intelligence and quantum computing for better environmental, social, and governance (ESG) analysis. The study will explore how educational initiatives, combined with increased awareness of emerging technologies such as AI and quantum computing, could significantly influence sustainable finance practices. The central hypothesis is that education in AI and quantum computing has a strong role to play in the promotion of responsible financial strategies toward sustainable and ethical business practices. To test this hypothesis, the research uses the non-probability sampling technique of convenience sampling to sample data from 175 respondents. The participants are major professionals and stakeholders in AI, finance, and sustainability who were surveyed using a Likert scale to assess their views on the impact of environmental, social, and governance (ESG) factors on educational awareness and its subsequent effect on sustainable finance. The findings show an association of educational awareness concerning AI and quantum computing with the improvement of the practice of sustainable finance. Actually, results show that increased educational awareness in AI and quantum technologies will improve ESG analysis knowledge, thus the quality of financial decisions. The research further reveals that it is highly dependent on both environmental, social, and governance factors in respect of educational awareness, indicating how such external drivers may play important roles in integrating AI and quantum computing into sustainable finance frameworks. This research contributes to the expanding literature on sustainable finance and responsible AI usage, providing practical insights for policymakers, educators, and financial institutions interested in integrating emerging technologies to better analyze and make decisions about ESG. The positive relationship between educational awareness and sustainable finance underlines the importance of continued investment in education and technological literacy to advance global sustainability goals. © 2025 Scrivener Publishing LLC.},
